cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fastCD in your work, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "fastCD: fast real Cayley–Dickson arithmetic"
abstract: >-
  A C library and NumPy-compatible Python extension for multiplication in the
  real Cayley–Dickson tower, including a quasilinear O(N log N) multiplication
  algorithm alongside the direct recursion and the Cariow–Cariowa algorithm.
authors:
  - family-names: Lemley
    given-names: Harrison
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-25
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://git.tanuki-cd.com/algebraity/fastCD"
keywords:
  - Cayley-Dickson algebras
  - hypercomplex numbers
  - quaternions
  - octonions
  - sedenions
  - fast multiplication
preferred-citation:
